OL,3,GNEWSAMan caught with #2.6m of cocaine
OL,4,Aamong Santa gift bags
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was caught with #2.6m of cocaine
OL,7,Fstashed among Santa gift bags after
OL,8,Fpolice raided a flat in Glasgow just
OL,9,Fdays before Christmas.
OL,11,FJordan Wetherill, 23, was found to have
OL,12,Fmore than 100 blocks of cocaine as well
OL,13,Fas a smaller amount of heroin at the
OL,14,Fhouse in Shettleston on December 21,
OL,15,F2025.
OL,17,FA judge was shown a short police video
OL,18,Fof the police operation with the huge
OL,19,Fhaul of drugs mainly lying taped up in
OL,20,Fthe living room among Santa gift bags.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
